Package: smartcleaner
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-psutil, python3-cryptography (>= 42)
Maintainer: SmartCleaner Team <team@smartcleaner.example>
Description: SmartCleaner 2.0 - System cleaning and optimization utility
 SmartCleaner is a professional system cleaning and optimization utility
 designed in CCleaner style for Linux (Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint).
 Features safe cleaning, disk analysis, duplicate finder, browser cache cleaning,
 driver manager, system diagnostics, and SmartCleaner Delete utility.
Homepage: https://smartcleaner.example
